       {
        "$type": "app.bsky.embed.images#image",
        "alt": "Line chart of annualized compute spending. Anthropic grows 4.0x per year (90% CI: 3.6x to 4.5x), reaching about $40 billion in late 2026. OpenAI grows 3x per year (90% CI: 2x to 5x), with a 2026 forecast of about $50 billion.",
