     },
     "facets": [],
     "langs": [
      "en"
     ],
     "text": "Anthropic’s compute spending is increasing by 4x per year, outpacing OpenAI’s 3x.\n\nPer its S-1, Anthropic spent $10 billion on compute and infrastructure in Q3 2026 alone, or $40 billion annualized, compared to $433 million in all of 2023."
